WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.968 --> 00:00:05.767
-Let's get to the news.

00:00:05.767 --> 00:00:09.033
President Biden made a surprise
trip last week to Ukraine

00:00:09.033 --> 00:00:11.067
by taking a 10-hour train ride,

00:00:11.067 --> 00:00:13.033
or as the guy next to him
thought,

00:00:13.033 --> 00:00:14.901
an 80-hour train ride.

00:00:14.901 --> 00:00:16.834
[ Laughter ]

00:00:16.834 --> 00:00:19.501
President Biden reportedly
had a difficult time sleeping

00:00:19.501 --> 00:00:22.534
last week on the overnight train
ride from Poland to Ukraine

00:00:22.534 --> 00:00:25.467
and read a briefing memo
on the history of Kyiv,

00:00:25.467 --> 00:00:28.801
and that didn't
put him to sleep?

00:00:28.801 --> 00:00:30.200
That would have
put the last president

00:00:30.200 --> 00:00:32.133
into a multi-year coma.

00:00:32.133 --> 00:00:33.667
[ Laughter ]

00:00:33.667 --> 00:00:35.934
In a new interview,
President Biden said

00:00:35.934 --> 00:00:37.934
that he has
"other things to finish

00:00:37.934 --> 00:00:40.501
before launching a full-blown
presidential campaign."

00:00:40.501 --> 00:00:42.634
Like, for instance,
"Yellowstone."

00:00:42.634 --> 00:00:44.934
[ Laughter ]

00:00:44.934 --> 00:00:46.901
According to a new report,
then-President Trump

00:00:46.901 --> 00:00:50.033
was so upset with "Late Night"
host Jimmy Kimmel's criticism

00:00:50.033 --> 00:00:51.133
that he asked
White House staffers

00:00:51.133 --> 00:00:52.667
to call Disney executives.

00:00:52.667 --> 00:00:56.400
And he was apparently so upset
with me that he called my boss.

00:00:56.400 --> 00:00:59.033
-That's right, Seth,
and I told him to get lost.

00:00:59.033 --> 00:01:01.133
[ Laughter ]
-Good looking out, Wally.

00:01:01.133 --> 00:01:03.601
Thank you.
-You're welcome. Yep.

00:01:03.601 --> 00:01:06.534
-Vice President Kamala Harris
spoke today in South Carolina

00:01:06.534 --> 00:01:08.868
about the Biden
administration's expansion

00:01:08.868 --> 00:01:10.834
of high-speed Internet access.

00:01:10.834 --> 00:01:11.968
Although, it didn't help matters

00:01:11.968 --> 00:01:14.334
that the live stream
started like this.

00:01:14.334 --> 00:01:17.200
[ Modem dialing ]

00:01:17.200 --> 00:01:19.901
[ Laughter ]

00:01:22.534 --> 00:01:23.534
[ Dialing stops ]

00:01:23.534 --> 00:01:25.601
An-n-n-nd we're live.

00:01:25.601 --> 00:01:27.234
[ Laughter ]

00:01:27.234 --> 00:01:29.434
House Republicans reportedly
planning to hold hearings

00:01:29.434 --> 00:01:31.234
on the Biden administration's
response

00:01:31.234 --> 00:01:34.267
to the toxic train wreck
in East Palestine, Ohio.

00:01:34.267 --> 00:01:36.133
And one way or another,
they're going to figure out

00:01:36.133 --> 00:01:39.100
how Hunter Biden
sabotaged that train.

00:01:39.100 --> 00:01:40.868
[ Laughter ]

00:01:40.868 --> 00:01:44.767
Florida Governor Ron DeSantis'
book "The Courage to be Free"

00:01:44.767 --> 00:01:46.467
is set to be released tomorrow.

00:01:46.467 --> 00:01:48.567
Look for it
wherever books are legal.

00:01:48.567 --> 00:01:52.634
[ Laughter ]

00:01:52.634 --> 00:01:55.467
Florida Governor Ron DeSantis
held a three-day retreat

00:01:55.467 --> 00:01:57.834
over the weekend for top donors
and supporters

00:01:57.834 --> 00:01:59.400
at the Four Seasons
in Palm Beach.

00:01:59.400 --> 00:02:02.467
For a $10,000 donation,
you got to meet him.

00:02:02.467 --> 00:02:04.901
And for $20,000, you didn't.

00:02:04.901 --> 00:02:08.167
[ Laughter ]

00:02:08.167 --> 00:02:09.834
An alligator
was recently captured

00:02:09.834 --> 00:02:12.701
in Brooklyn's Prospect Park
and taken to the Bronx Zoo.

00:02:12.701 --> 00:02:15.567
You made it move from Brooklyn
to the Bronx?

00:02:15.567 --> 00:02:17.033
[ Laughter ]

00:02:17.033 --> 00:02:19.801
At least try turn it into boots
and let it die with dignity.

00:02:19.801 --> 00:02:24.501
[ Laughter ]

00:02:24.501 --> 00:02:26.467
Firefighters in North Carolina

00:02:26.467 --> 00:02:28.100
recently rescued
a newlywed couple

00:02:28.100 --> 00:02:30.567
that got stuck
in an elevator for 2.5 hours

00:02:30.567 --> 00:02:31.567
after their wedding.

00:02:31.567 --> 00:02:32.801
The couple is doing fine

00:02:32.801 --> 00:02:35.000
and ready to get on
with their divorce.

00:02:35.000 --> 00:02:39.734
[ Laughter ]

00:02:39.734 --> 00:02:42.234
And finally, a woman in Georgia
was arrested last week

00:02:42.234 --> 00:02:45.400
after she allegedly drove her
car into a Popeyes restaurant

00:02:45.400 --> 00:02:47.701
because her order
did not have biscuits.

00:02:47.701 --> 00:02:48.767
[ Laughter ]

00:02:48.767 --> 00:02:50.100
Apparently, those biscuits

00:02:50.100 --> 00:02:52.400
are the only thing that
take the edge off the meth.

00:02:52.400 --> 00:02:53.834
[ Laughter ]

00:02:53.834 --> 00:02:57.167
President Biden held an event
yesterday at the White House

00:02:57.167 --> 00:02:58.868
celebrating Black History Month.

00:02:58.868 --> 00:03:00.767
Also being held at
the White House,

00:03:00.767 --> 00:03:02.467
everyone's breath.

00:03:02.467 --> 00:03:04.767
[ Laughter ]

00:03:04.767 --> 00:03:06.801
[ Applause ]

00:03:06.801 --> 00:03:08.300
[ Laughter ]

00:03:08.300 --> 00:03:10.133
That's right.
President Biden held an event

00:03:10.133 --> 00:03:12.901
yesterday at the White House
celebrating Black History Month.

00:03:12.901 --> 00:03:15.501
Man, how many times do you
think he casually

00:03:15.501 --> 00:03:17.133
mentioned knowing Obama?

00:03:17.133 --> 00:03:18.434
[ Laughter ]

00:03:18.434 --> 00:03:20.501
"So I was talking to Barry
the other day --

00:03:20.501 --> 00:03:26.367
sorry, Barack -- Obama,
former co-worker."

00:03:26.367 --> 00:03:28.434
[ Laughter ]

00:03:28.434 --> 00:03:30.400
When asked in a new interview
if he's planning on running

00:03:30.400 --> 00:03:33.567
for re-election in 2024,
President Biden joked that

00:03:33.567 --> 00:03:37.334
he needed to call First Lady
Dr. Jill Biden to "find out."

00:03:37.334 --> 00:03:42.234
Okay, but you know she's not
that kind of doctor, right?

00:03:42.234 --> 00:03:44.300
[ Laughter ]

00:03:44.300 --> 00:03:47.434
Florida governor Ron DeSantis
signed a bill into law yesterday

00:03:47.434 --> 00:03:50.601
that takes away Disney World's
self-governing status.

00:03:50.601 --> 00:03:53.100
So, if you're at Disney --
[ Audience boos ]

00:03:53.100 --> 00:03:55.667
If you're at Disney,
I have even more bad news.

00:03:55.667 --> 00:03:57.834
Now you're also in Florida.

00:03:57.834 --> 00:04:02.033
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:02.033 --> 00:04:05.334
Georgia Congresswoman
Marjorie Taylor Greene said

00:04:05.334 --> 00:04:07.601
in a Twitter post last night
that she was attacked

00:04:07.601 --> 00:04:09.868
by an insane woman
inside a restaurant.

00:04:09.868 --> 00:04:12.901
Luckily the incident was
resolved after the restaurant

00:04:12.901 --> 00:04:14.400
took the mirror down.

00:04:14.400 --> 00:04:15.901
[ Laughter ]

00:04:15.901 --> 00:04:19.501
"That's my outfit."

00:04:19.501 --> 00:04:22.434
According to a new poll,
66% of New York voters believe

00:04:22.434 --> 00:04:24.901
that Republican Congressman
George Santos should step down,

00:04:24.901 --> 00:04:27.901
while the other 34% believe
anything apparently.

00:04:27.901 --> 00:04:29.400
[ Laughter ]

00:04:29.400 --> 00:04:31.834
Authorities in Minnesota
recently arrested a man

00:04:31.834 --> 00:04:34.734
on suspicion of drunk driving
after he allegedly fell

00:04:34.734 --> 00:04:36.734
asleep in an Arby's
drive-through.

00:04:36.734 --> 00:04:39.567
It's the rare occasion
where drunk driving

00:04:39.567 --> 00:04:41.334
may have saved someone's life.

00:04:41.334 --> 00:04:43.400
[ Laughter ]

00:04:43.400 --> 00:04:46.601
A Chinese company has begun
offering a device that simulates

00:04:46.601 --> 00:04:49.234
kissing using a set
of silicon lips

00:04:49.234 --> 00:04:50.801
controlled by an app.

00:04:50.801 --> 00:04:51.901
Yeah...

00:04:51.901 --> 00:04:53.434
[ Laughter ]

00:04:53.434 --> 00:04:55.200
That's what it will be used for.

00:04:55.200 --> 00:04:57.467
[ Laughter ]

00:05:00.167 --> 00:05:04.000
"I'm going to sell this to you.

00:05:04.000 --> 00:05:06.234
Kissing only, alright, man?"

00:05:08.033 --> 00:05:10.400
"Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:05:10.400 --> 00:05:11.968
No, I love kissing."

00:05:11.968 --> 00:05:15.434
[ Laughter ]

00:05:15.434 --> 00:05:17.667
And -- [ Laughs ]

00:05:20.267 --> 00:05:22.667
And finally, a man in California
recently broke

00:05:22.667 --> 00:05:24.868
the Guinness world record
for most consecutive visits

00:05:24.868 --> 00:05:28.667
to Disneyland after visiting
the park nearly 3,000 times.

00:05:28.667 --> 00:05:32.167
Even crazier, this guy's been
to SeaWorld twice.

00:05:32.167 --> 00:05:34.200
[ Laughter ]

00:05:34.200 --> 00:05:35.934
President Biden kicked off

00:05:35.934 --> 00:05:38.300
House Democrats' 3-day retreat
tonight

00:05:38.300 --> 00:05:39.634
with a speech in Baltimore.

00:05:39.634 --> 00:05:42.067
Well, it was supposed to be
a one-day retreat,

00:05:42.067 --> 00:05:44.100
but when that guy gets
talking...

00:05:44.100 --> 00:05:45.901
[ Laughter ]

00:05:45.901 --> 00:05:48.601
The Biden administration
said this week

00:05:48.601 --> 00:05:51.300
that federal agencies will
have to remove TikTok

00:05:51.300 --> 00:05:53.601
from all government devices
in 30 days,

00:05:53.601 --> 00:05:55.667
and if they're smart, Venmo.

00:05:55.667 --> 00:05:56.834
Matt?

00:05:56.834 --> 00:05:59.634
[ Laughter ]

00:05:59.634 --> 00:06:01.934
In a post yesterday
on Truth Social,

00:06:01.934 --> 00:06:05.167
Former President Trump accused
Florida governor Ron DeSantis

00:06:05.167 --> 00:06:07.767
of wanting to cut
Social Security and Medicare,

00:06:07.767 --> 00:06:11.701
and said he was a "wheelchair
over the cliff" kind of guy.

00:06:11.701 --> 00:06:13.133
As opposed to Trump, who would

00:06:13.133 --> 00:06:15.400
never waste a perfectly good
wheelchair.

00:06:15.400 --> 00:06:17.200
[ Laughter ]

00:06:17.200 --> 00:06:21.100
Mexican President Lopez Obrador
pushed back against criticism

00:06:21.100 --> 00:06:23.834
yesterday of his recent
electoral reforms and said,

00:06:23.834 --> 00:06:25.934
"There is more democracy
in Mexico

00:06:25.934 --> 00:06:27.934
than could exist in
the United States."

00:06:27.934 --> 00:06:30.934
Well, that's not the high bar
it used to be.

00:06:30.934 --> 00:06:32.334
[ Laughter ]

00:06:32.334 --> 00:06:33.601
That's like me saying I'm

00:06:33.601 --> 00:06:35.667
a better tennis player
than Richard Kind,

00:06:35.667 --> 00:06:38.234
who's backstage,

00:06:38.234 --> 00:06:40.067
and we're gonna find out
when he comes out

00:06:40.067 --> 00:06:41.133
if he thinks he can
beat me in tennis,

00:06:41.133 --> 00:06:43.334
'cause I bet he probably could.

00:06:43.334 --> 00:06:45.734
During oral arguments yesterday
in a case challenging

00:06:45.734 --> 00:06:48.234
President Biden's student debt
forgiveness plan,

00:06:48.234 --> 00:06:50.267
Supreme Court Justice
Neil Gorsuch

00:06:50.267 --> 00:06:53.033
said the program was unfair
and failed to take into account

00:06:53.033 --> 00:06:55.801
people who had paid off
their loans or never had them.

00:06:55.801 --> 00:06:58.267
Yeah, can someone for once

00:06:58.267 --> 00:07:01.901
think of the people
who never had student loans?

00:07:01.901 --> 00:07:04.901
When do they get a break?

00:07:04.901 --> 00:07:06.834
That's like saying no Tinder,

00:07:06.834 --> 00:07:09.701
it's not fair to the people
who already get laid.

00:07:09.701 --> 00:07:12.000
[ Laughter ]

00:07:12.000 --> 00:07:14.901
Television provider Dish Network
confirmed yesterday

00:07:14.901 --> 00:07:17.133
that a previous outage
was caused by

00:07:17.133 --> 00:07:20.067
a cybersecurity breach,
and not, as customers assumed,

00:07:20.067 --> 00:07:21.601
by a gentle rain.

00:07:21.601 --> 00:07:24.901
[ Laughter ]

00:07:24.901 --> 00:07:27.601
Dictionary.com yesterday
unveiled new entries,

00:07:27.601 --> 00:07:28.801
including the word "woke."

00:07:28.801 --> 00:07:30.968
"Still not gonna look it up!"
said Republicans.

00:07:30.968 --> 00:07:33.200
[ Laughter ]

00:07:33.200 --> 00:07:35.534
A Florida woman was arrested
last week

00:07:35.534 --> 00:07:38.167
after she told deputies
during a traffic stop

00:07:38.167 --> 00:07:39.934
she had drugs in
her body cavity,

00:07:39.934 --> 00:07:43.801
and removed nearly 11 grams
of crystal meth.

00:07:43.801 --> 00:07:46.167
Said the cops,
"Ma'am, we pulled you over

00:07:46.167 --> 00:07:47.434
for a broken tail light."

00:07:47.434 --> 00:07:51.100
[ Laughter ]

00:07:51.100 --> 00:07:54.968
"Still, pretty impressive,
though, officers."

00:07:54.968 --> 00:07:57.133
Fast food chain KFC
today announced

00:07:57.133 --> 00:07:59.901
the return of the Double Down,
a bun-free sandwich

00:07:59.901 --> 00:08:01.934
that substitutes bread
with chicken,

00:08:01.934 --> 00:08:05.000
so you can substitute
hunger with self-loathing.

00:08:05.000 --> 00:08:06.467
[ Laughter ]

00:08:06.467 --> 00:08:09.601
And finally, the pharmaceutical
company Eli Lilly

00:08:09.601 --> 00:08:10.901
announced today that it will cap

00:08:10.901 --> 00:08:13.534
the out-of-pocket cost
of insulin at $35 --

00:08:13.534 --> 00:08:15.934
and not a moment too soon.

00:08:15.934 --> 00:08:17.534
[ Laughter ]

00:08:17.534 --> 00:08:19.167
President Biden criticized

00:08:19.167 --> 00:08:21.667
Georgia Congresswoman Marjorie
Taylor Greene yesterday,

00:08:21.667 --> 00:08:24.701
and suggested that her politics
are causing Republicans

00:08:24.701 --> 00:08:26.234
to join the Democratic Party.

00:08:26.234 --> 00:08:28.334
Oh, come on,
we can't even get Democrats

00:08:28.334 --> 00:08:30.000
to join the Democratic Party.

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:31.467
[ Laughter ]

00:08:31.467 --> 00:08:34.133
According to a new poll,
68% of voters said that

00:08:34.133 --> 00:08:36.567
President Biden is too old
for another term.

00:08:36.567 --> 00:08:39.501
I don't know. I mean, okay,
he's an 80-year-old man.

00:08:39.501 --> 00:08:41.033
But the job is mostly

00:08:41.033 --> 00:08:43.334
telling long stories
that don't go anywhere...

00:08:43.334 --> 00:08:44.601
[ Laughter ]

00:08:44.601 --> 00:08:48.000
...signing whatever
a young person hands you...

00:08:48.000 --> 00:08:50.767
and arguing with foreigners
and drug companies.

00:08:50.767 --> 00:08:53.601
Man for the job, I say.

00:08:53.601 --> 00:08:56.834
The House Foreign Affairs
committee voted yesterday

00:08:56.834 --> 00:08:58.234
to advance a bill

00:08:58.234 --> 00:09:00.400
that would allow
President Biden to ban TikTok.

00:09:00.400 --> 00:09:03.734
Ban it? He hasn't even
figured out how to download it.

00:09:03.734 --> 00:09:05.400
[ Laughter ]

00:09:05.400 --> 00:09:07.300
"Hello,
TikTok customer service?"

00:09:07.300 --> 00:09:09.734
[ Light laughter ]

00:09:09.734 --> 00:09:11.767
A spokesperson for
the Chinese Foreign Ministry

00:09:11.767 --> 00:09:14.400
said today that the U.S.
should cease weapon sales

00:09:14.400 --> 00:09:16.067
and military contact
with Taiwan.

00:09:16.067 --> 00:09:18.367
Oh, what are you going to do,
send another balloon?

00:09:18.367 --> 00:09:19.934
I'd like to see you try!

00:09:19.934 --> 00:09:22.467
[ Laughter ]
Oh, damn, that was fast, wow.

00:09:22.467 --> 00:09:25.100
[ Laughter ]
It's right outside.

00:09:25.100 --> 00:09:28.000
Vermont Senator Bernie Sanders
recently released a new book

00:09:28.000 --> 00:09:30.567
titled "It's OK to be Angry
About Capitalism."

00:09:30.567 --> 00:09:33.300
And if you still don't believe
him, you can look at the price.

00:09:33.300 --> 00:09:37.033
[ Laughter ]
That's right.

00:09:37.033 --> 00:09:40.200
Bernie Sanders recently
released a new book titled

00:09:40.200 --> 00:09:42.267
"It's OK to be Angry About
Capitalism."

00:09:42.267 --> 00:09:45.000
And if you like that, check out
the rest of the books in his

00:09:45.000 --> 00:09:46.834
"It's OK to be Angry"
collection.

00:09:46.834 --> 00:09:49.067
[ Laughter ]

00:09:49.067 --> 00:09:51.133
The Supreme Court
heard arguments yesterday

00:09:51.133 --> 00:09:53.467
in a dispute between
New York and New Jersey.

00:09:53.467 --> 00:09:56.767
It was the case of "ayy!"
versus "ohhh!"

00:09:56.767 --> 00:09:59.601
[ Laughter ]

00:09:59.601 --> 00:10:01.701
A very subtle...

00:10:01.701 --> 00:10:03.734
very subtle but real difference.

00:10:03.734 --> 00:10:05.501
[ Light laughter ]

00:10:05.501 --> 00:10:07.801
"The New York Times"
published a profile yesterday

00:10:07.801 --> 00:10:10.667
of a man who has
lived his life mostly barefoot

00:10:10.667 --> 00:10:11.901
for the past 20 years.

00:10:11.901 --> 00:10:14.234
And bad news,
he's on your flight.

00:10:14.234 --> 00:10:17.133
[ Laughter ]

00:10:17.133 --> 00:10:19.767
Producers have announced
that actress Bebe Neuwirth

00:10:19.767 --> 00:10:22.400
will return for the revival
of the sitcom "Frasier"

00:10:22.400 --> 00:10:24.300
to repr-- to reprise --
excuse me --

00:10:24.300 --> 00:10:25.734
her role as Lilith Sternin.

00:10:25.734 --> 00:10:27.801
Not returning, Eddie the dog.

00:10:27.801 --> 00:10:30.901
[ Audience aws ]

00:10:35.400 --> 00:10:37.767
Yeah, you guys thought you
didn't like that barefoot joke.

00:10:37.767 --> 00:10:39.167
[ Laughter ]

00:10:39.167 --> 00:10:41.300
You didn't realize that --
those were the heights.

00:10:41.300 --> 00:10:42.968
[ Light laughter ]

00:10:42.968 --> 00:10:44.901
Officials at a zoo in Nebraska
this week

00:10:44.901 --> 00:10:47.801
confirmed that a cheetah briefly
escaped from its enclosure.

00:10:47.801 --> 00:10:49.167
Oh, good, only briefly.

00:10:49.167 --> 00:10:51.567
It's just a cheetah.
How far could it have gotten?

00:10:51.567 --> 00:10:53.634
[ Laughter ]

00:10:56.200 --> 00:10:57.667
It was chasing Eddie.

00:10:57.667 --> 00:11:00.534
[ Light laughter ]

00:11:02.334 --> 00:11:04.667
According to a new survey,
the Tooth Fairy now leaves

00:11:04.667 --> 00:11:06.734
more than $6 per tooth
on average,

00:11:06.734 --> 00:11:08.300
which explains
the recent increase

00:11:08.300 --> 00:11:10.100
in 7-year-olds
taking up hockey.

00:11:10.100 --> 00:11:12.434
[ Laughter ]

00:11:12.434 --> 00:11:15.067
And finally, a cruise line
is now accepting reservations

00:11:15.067 --> 00:11:17.400
for the first ever
three-year-long cruise,

00:11:17.400 --> 00:11:18.834
two years with good behavior.

00:11:18.834 --> 00:11:20.133
And...

00:11:20.133 --> 00:11:21.968
that was the monologue,
everybody!

00:11:21.968 --> 00:11:26.968
♪♪

